WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.240
Queen's Blade.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.650
Everything is in accordance with the Queen's will.{Everything is the queen's will.}

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:09.980
The warriors are still unaware of the time, place, or opponent of their next battle.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:16.030
Fate is said to be ironic; it bewilders the hearts and minds of the warriors.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.340
Yes, I'm Nyx!

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.510
The righteous Flame Master, Nyx!

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.270
What justice? Don't make me laugh.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:13.050
The sky will not fall, the sea will not dry, and the earth will not split.

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:19.680
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:33.110
Just as I can see no end to this sky,

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:40.030
I inherit the will and strength that will exist forever.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:46.370
With each person carrying different feelings in their heart,

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:54.090
When the time comes, they will fulfill their promise with that special someone.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:58.510
In order to become

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:03.680
the chosen ruler of this world,

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:07.770
I will shake off any pain I feel.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:15.030
The sky will not fall, the sea will not drought, and the earth will not split.

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:21.070
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:28.080
No one shall stop me on my path.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.270
Are you frustrated?

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.620
I'm sure you are.

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:48.380
Because, the awe-inspiring Imperial Captain, Elina,

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:51.870
is being trampled on by a <i>former</i> servant, after all.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:52.860
Shit!

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:58.080
How many years have I been longing for this moment?

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:02.990
What's this?

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:05.230
Um, is something the matter?

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:08.450
This isn't the cup I wanted.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.290
B-But yesterday-

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.760
I wanted one with a flower pattern today.

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:15.880
I'm very sorry, I'll bring one with a flower pattern right away.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:16.760
Forget it.

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:20.560
You really are useless, eh?

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:29.520
There's still a spot here.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.480
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.740
Do it all again.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:37.040
You mean... everything?

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.350
Naturally.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:47.290
Day after day, I was oppressed by some selfish aristocrat like you.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.580
But you know...

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.640
I'm no longer the person I was before.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:14.480
After meeting Funikura-sama, I was reborn as the strongest warrior; I'll no longer lose to anyone.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:20.650
I must thank the Queen for arranging this battle.

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:23.950
The ancient demonic being, Funikura, huh?

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:44.710
Elina is at an obvious disadvantage in this battle.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:48.220
Was this all part of the Queen's plot?

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:51.640
So it's bothering you, after all?

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:55.520
Well, it is your younger sister who's fighting.

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.790
It is understandable that you'd be worried.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.980
Though you may wish for her victory,

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:02.570
if you also hope to be victorious, you're destined to cross swords with her eventually.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:03.820
A foolish question.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.700
Blood ties hold no meaning in battle.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.490
So you say...

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:11.730
I will now return this sword

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.370
with which you may attack me in the near future.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.870
You are the only one whom I can entrust with this sword.

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:22.510
You have my gratitude.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:28.500
A lady such as you is fit to be Queen.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.930
Well then, I'll be excusing myself.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:36.740
Come, Rana.

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.140
Yeah.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.400
I heard you're searching for your father?

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:46.240
Yes.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.790
Well, then...

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.750
I will also pray for your reunion.

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:51.450
Thank you!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:01.920
Well then, if you apologize for everything you've done, I'll make your defeat painless.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:02.610
Who would...

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:06.340
Don't get so full of yourself, you servant.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.800
Didn't I tell you I'm not a servant anymore!?

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.760
That settles it.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:13.510
I don't remember you.

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:14.840
But...

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:19.820
You're just a gloomy, crybaby servant who got a bit full of herself, so...

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:23.440
I don't like it, I don't like it, I don't like it!

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:27.900
I'll make you regret putting me in a bad mood.

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:30.450
S-shut up!

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.720
That's right, you've been exposed.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:39.830
You can't do anything by yourself, you incompetent woman.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:42.040
It's all that staff's power, isn't it?

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:47.880
You act smart, but you're just a whiny little brat, aren't you?

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:52.190
Oh, that's no good. You're just embarrassing yourself again here.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:56.590
You really are useless.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:08.840
P-please forgive me...

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:14.510
I won't be weak anymore, Funikura-sama!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.330
Well then...

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.950
My younger sister is quite skilled, as always.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.680
What are you doing?

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.500
I'm saying that my bare hands are more than enough for someone like you.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.570
S-stop messing around!

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:43.900
You incompetent, crybaby, trash woman.

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:48.230
Without that staff, your existence has no meaning.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:51.240
I'm not afraid of such a person at all.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.090
Shut up!

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:59.380
I'll kill you! Let's duel unarmed! I'll show you that I'm stronger!

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:00.190
You?

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.330
As I thought, you really are a lost cause.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.750
Funikura-sama!

00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:08.850
Got you.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.340
Funikura-sama!

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:18.800
You're throwing me away for such a woman?!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:22.440
Stop clinging to me, it's annoying.

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.150
Funikura-sama!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:29.200
Come get me, you trash.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:36.180
I-I forfeit.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:49.920
Onii-chan.

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:53.290
Onii-chan!

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.400
For justice to be defeated like this...

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.190
by such a heartless person.

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:28.380
Funikura-sama! Where did you go?!

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:34.120
Life isn't only about painful things.

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:35.520
Try your best, lady.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.890
I won't praise your fighting spirit in your last moments.

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.740
I do not know what you intended to do in this world, but...

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.110
That's right.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:13.000
We don't need something like an ancient demonic being on this continent.

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:16.760
There are many more who will get in our way.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.970
We can't relax yet.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:20.930
My beloved Aldra.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.030
I'm aware of that.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:36.100
Ah, damn. She gave me a bruise in such a place.

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:39.110
I don't care about that woman.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:43.350
I want to win against Leina and show her my flames of passion, but...

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.290
Oh, Leina!

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.730
Though you may wish for her victory,

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:53.370
if you also hope to be victorious, you're destined to cross swords with her eventually.

00:10:55.570 --> 00:11:00.720
Perhaps I should also think as simply as she does.

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:03.870
Father...

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:08.960
Congratulations, Tomoe!

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.560
That was an amazing battle.

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:13.210
Here, take this.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:15.380
T-thank you very much.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.190
I brought cake to congratulate you.

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:20.320
Your thoughtfulness makes me happy.

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:22.050
However...

00:11:22.050 --> 00:11:24.910
please consider gestures like these to be unnecessary from now on.

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:29.650
We are kindred souls participating in Queen's Blade.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.920
Anything more than this liaison is excessive.

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:36.050
I see. You're right.

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:38.130
I understand.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.370
If you say so...

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:47.380
It's for the best.

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:51.810
Sympathy will be a hindrance to your battles from now on.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:53.210
I realize that.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:56.650
I am only focusing on carrying out my mission.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:58.570
Shizuka-san?

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.640
W-what?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:04.430
This gift has a very pleasant aroma.

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:09.380
R-really.

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:11.910
It seems very sweet and delicious.

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:16.460
Instructor! Hurry, hurry!

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.180
They're going to sell out!

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:19.740
Eh?

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:21.020
Instructor?

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:21.920
Ru?

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:26.920
Huh? What? Did everyone get lost?

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:30.620
Hey, cute little girl.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:33.350
Yes, you. Are you alone?

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:45.520
A young elf girl, eh?

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.420
A fine bargain.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.210
This one's great.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:57.630
Be obedient for a little while.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.500
Just close your eyes, and it'll all be over soon.

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:04.100
I-Instructor.

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:07.020
Who are you?

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:10.320
Instructor!

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.350
Are you hurt?

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:17.170
Thank you.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:23.650
Ru!

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:25.990
Get away from Nowa.

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:27.110
Instructor!

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.660
The thousand year virgin, eh?

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:32.120
Don't get close to Nowa.

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:33.080
Get out of my sight.

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:35.810
Sure, sure.

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.620
See you, Nowa.

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.840
Instructor, do you know that person?

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.030
Even though I told you so many times to stay close to me...

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:49.790
Nowa, 15 points.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:51.170
I'm sorry.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:54.980
But Instructor, do you know that person?

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:55.720
Let's go.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.110
Grandmother!

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:05.280
I beg of you, please forgive my worthlessness.

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:10.200
Hey Melpha! What about dinner?

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:12.160
Melpha?

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:16.860
Great archangel.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:18.890
Please stay healthy.

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:23.460
You're leaving?!

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:28.850
I failed in Queen's Blade due to my lack of piety.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:33.430
I am going on a journey in pursuit of knowledge; I've decided to start over.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:36.890
You... you're gutless!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:42.280
You talk about things like piety...

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:45.530
but in reality, you're only running away from your defeat!

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:48.200
A pursuit of knowledge?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:51.520
If that's the case, why not ask <i>me</i>?

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:55.540
That's right, the great archangel, Nanael-sama, will guide you!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.340
It is as you say, great archangel.

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:14.050
I was unconsciously trying to escape from reality.

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:17.490
Thank you very much, great archangel!

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:21.180
As long as you understand.

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:23.930
Revere me by bringing me food.

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:24.650
Yes.

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:29.740
If you weren't here, who would take care of me from tomorrow onwards!

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:34.130
What are you doing?

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:39.960
This may be sudden, but please give guidance to my worthless self.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:42.890
T-that's...

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:43.740
that erotic book!

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:48.930
Here we go. Holy pose!

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.230
Decalogue!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:57.640
W-why do I have to make such a pose?!

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.980
Melona went off somewhere, and her whereabouts are unknown...

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:10.650
Oh! Look, Princess, there's a nice woman over there too!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.780
This city is quite nice.

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.490
Indeed.

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:19.870
This place can become Amar's new capital upon my victory.

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:23.920
To start, the new royal palace should be around there.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:27.460
Don't we have to assemble talented people for this first?

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:29.210
You're right.

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:34.550
From tomorrow on, in order to accelerate our employment, we'll expand our influence.

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:38.800
With Menace like this...

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:40.020
at this rate...

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:47.410
we'll certainly be punished by the master.

00:16:56.350 --> 00:17:01.200
From now on, you'll work together with me in this city.

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:03.580
Together?

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:06.500
Yes. We'll be together forever.

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:09.980
I will...

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:10.800
not betray.

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:29.650
Welcome.

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:38.600
I wonder if I'll have to fight you, Instructor.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:41.480
This is also fate, my pupil.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:45.580
It is time for you to show me the results of your training.

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:49.960
Even if Instructor is my opponent, I'll fight with all my strength!

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:51.700
Your spirit is acceptable.

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.260
Nowa, 95 points.

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:58.010
Members of Kiba...

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:10.810
Those people...

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.960
will become your your hands and feet.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:15.190
Members of Kiba, this is Risty.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:38.510
So you're my opponent?

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.470
That makes me happy.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:41.810
At last...

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:43.850
we can cross swords.

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.110
Do you want to prove your skills to me?

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.410
I'm looking forward to it.

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:51.190
You should lower your head!

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:56.280
Oh? So you hated me this much?

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:59.160
And you were so cute back then.

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.720
During the day, and at night, too...

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:04.790
You...

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:11.540
You were fearful of the Kiba assassins and disappeared before my eyes.

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:15.250
You betrayed me!

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:18.150
So you're still thinking about me?

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:21.680
That side of you is just too cute.

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:22.660
Shut up!

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:48.080
You've grown well.

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:53.380
On that day, a little child was crying, having lost her way.

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.340
Weak one.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:05.220
Instead of crying, use this and open a path for yourself with your own strength.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:09.950
If you are prepared to live in this forest, then...

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:12.830
I will teach you everything.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.890
Flowing attacks.

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:22.620
The ability to focus at will.

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.220
Nowa...

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:25.250
85 points.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.670
I won't lose.

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:39.170
I want to put Instructor at ease...

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:43.190
and show her that I'm fine by myself, so...

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:45.910
Nowa! I would expect nothing less from my pupil.

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:50.430
What's that?

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:54.040
It seems that there are others fighting here, as well.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:57.750
It's you two.

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.820
Huh? Huh? What, what?!

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.380
Calm down, Nowa. 40 points.

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:04.200
From here onwards...

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:07.620
Queen's Blade will commence.

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:10.540
Veteran Mercenary, Echidna...

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.460
and Kiba Assassin, Irma.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.520
Will be facing...

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:16.370
Combat Instructor, Alliene...

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:19.460
and Forest Guardian, Nowa.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:23.050
These two teams will cooperate with each other.

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:27.470
This is the Queen's will.

00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:33.020
The idea that deep bonds between teacher and student affect the outcome of battle...

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:34.510
is nothing more than an illusion.

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:37.440
Please watch...

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.460
my beloved Aldra.

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:48.620
I wonder in what a heart throbbing way I should make you mero - mero!

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:50.910
I'm having fun already just by thinking about it.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:54.410
I'll show you all that I'm the luckiest one in the end.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:57.790
So everyone! Let's fight until we're all melted.

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.540
Swamp Witch.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.250
An eerie existence.

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.940
Well, we're all girls of the underworld.

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:05.920
Majestic orders.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:07.550
Oh, Swamp Witch.

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:09.070
Such erotic actions.

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:10.580
We'll truly show our love for you.

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:11.310
Yes.

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:13.790
The three of us will all serve you.

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:14.540
Really?

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:15.430
Most likely.

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:17.630
Girls, let's all do our jobs properly.

00:23:13.670 --> 00:23:15.310
Hi! I'm Melona.

00:23:15.310 --> 00:23:17.360
It may seem like I'm out of the picture...

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:19.120
but actually, this is all part of my plan.

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:21.910
I've infiltrated enemy territory and I'm waiting for my chance.

00:23:21.910 --> 00:23:24.250
Now is certainly the time for patience.

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:26.200
I'm not making excuses, okay?

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:30.050
I'm definitely not, so all of you at home, remember that!

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:30.770
Let's see...

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:35.510
The next episode features warriors who are swayed by the Queen's extremely unfair match-ups.

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:36.830
It's beautiful.

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:39.680
Next time: Confrontation! Bonds Calling Out to Each Other.

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:42.400
What did those newcomers look like again?
